 R←Test_API_035(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;qdmx
⍝ Runs "Diff" with an op-code that does not exist. The :Select had no :Else, so anything but
⍝ "all" or "stage" silently behaved like "work".
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir

 :Trap 0
     {}'nonsense'G.Diff tempDir
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Invalid op-code'⍷qdmx.EM,qdmx.Message
 :EndTrap

 ⍝ ... while the documented op-codes still work
 {}'all'G.Diff tempDir
 {}'stage'G.Diff tempDir
 {}'work'G.Diff tempDir

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
